{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37793","headline":"寄题诗僧秀公 · 郑谷","name":"寄题诗僧秀公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵一心传清塞心，可公吟後楚公吟。\n近来雅道相亲少，唯仰吾师所得深。\n好句未停无暇日，旧山归老有东林。\n冷曹孤宦甘寥落，多谢携筇数访寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}